{"id":"d9079ff86c","t":"Reborn As The Heavenly Demon","c":"cv","n":149,"l":148,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon"},"u":1795038124951,"desc":"تيان هِيجين، زعيم تحالف “الدم الحديدي” المُهاب، يَستيقظ فجأة ليجد نفسه في جسد “بي ليدوان” – وصمة عار عائلته! حياة “بي ليدوان” كانت مزرية، فكان مُقامر ومُدمن كحول. وبين عشية وضحاها، تحول تيان هِيجين من أعظم سادة فنون القتال في جيانغهو إلى أشدُ قطع القمامة قذارة، تجسد بجسد بي ليدوان. وكأن هناك من يهمس في أذنه: “لنبدأ من الصفر، سأحقق كل مجدٍ لم أحققه في حياتي السابقة!”","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اكشن","تناسخ","فنون قتاليه","موريم"],"src":{"ml":"reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon|/manga/reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon/1/"},"2":{"ml":"reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon|/manga/reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon/2/"},"3":{"ml":"reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon|/manga/reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon/3/"},"4":{"ml":"reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon|/manga/reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon/4/"},"5":{"ml":"reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon|/manga/reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon/5/"},"6":{"ml":"reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon|/manga/reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon/6/"},"7":{"ml":"reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon|/manga/reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon/7/"},"8":{"ml":"reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon|/manga/reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon/8/"},"9":{"ml":"reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon|/manga/reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon/9/"},"10":{"ml":"reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon|/manga/reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon/10/"},"11":{"ml":"reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon|/manga/reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon/11/"},"12":{"ml":"reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon|/manga/reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon/12/"},"13":{"ml":"reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon|/manga/reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon/13/"},"14":{"ml":"reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon|/manga/reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon/14/"},"15":{"ml":"reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon|/manga/reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon/15/"},"16":{"ml":"reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon|/manga/reborn-as-the-heavenly-demon/16/"},"17":{"ml":"reborn-as-the-hea